From 6d5fe6e5a4c0bd141160bc5c22384639714a2042 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sneezeparty <38020091+sneezeparty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 07:49:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] applets/pager: Fixes for live thumbnails

- A click on a tile no longer resets the model, which restarted every
  desktop's stream.
- A window being dragged is drawn, also when the outlines are off.
- No application icons on rectangles that are only drag handles.
- The streams are paused while a fullscreen window is in use on the
  pager's screen.
- The wallpaper lookup only reads the config files again when they
  changed, and only reports a change when there is one.
- Mirrored screens, and centered and tiled wallpapers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
